{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"structural_monotony\",\"verdict\":\"undercall\",\"rationale\":\"The document is largely a series of similarly shaped status bullets: item name, current state, and next review/action. Calling the sections variable misses that repeated arc.\",\"evidence\":[\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"- Information in steps: Reviewed on Tuesday, up again next week:\",\"- Fixed Reference Points: Reviewed on Tuesday, up again next week:\",\"- Find help: Up for 1st review Dec 10th.\",\"- Confirmation before submission: Up for 1st review Dec 10th.\"]},{\"id\":\"tonal_uniformity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The conclusion is plausible because the note maintains one administrative update register, but the annotator supplied no evidence to establish that whole-document judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"Hi everyone,\",\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"There are a couple more that you can find here:\",\"Kind regards,\"]},{\"id\":\"faux_specificity\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The document is a plain project-status update and does not rely on pseudo-concrete sensory filler or generic lived-detail placeholders.\",\"evidence\":[\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"- Touch target spacing: Worry that it could in some (key) scenarios encourage people to shrink targets and add spacing, rather than increase the spacing per-se.\",\"- Dragging: Up for 1st review Jan 7th.\"]},{\"id\":\"neutrality_collapse\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The text makes concrete status assessments and recommendations rather than flattening everything into both-sides framing.\",\"evidence\":[\"Updates needed prior to re-review.\",\"needs to be re-scheduled,\",\"Visible labels & Orientation were thought to be possible to cover with understanding/technique updates.\"]},{\"id\":\"even_jargon_distribution\",\"verdict\":\"misclassified\",\"rationale\":\"Specialized terms appear throughout the message as part of the subject matter rather than clumping in one expert-only section. The better judgment is that jargon spreads naturally, not that it clumps.\",\"evidence\":[\"Initial approval of the SC text & documents, these have been made into a Pull Request (PR) on github\",\"That will go out for CFC soon.\",\"There is also a somewhat separate option to add techniques for personalisation once that spec reaches recommendation.\"]},{\"id\":\"forced_synesthesia\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"There are no cross-modal metaphors or sensory mappings of the kind this check targets.\",\"evidence\":[\"Some concerns about how to define the visual aspects\",\"Worry that it could in some (key) scenarios encourage people to shrink targets\",\"those are the main ones in progress right now.\"]},{\"id\":\"generic_metaphors\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The document is literal and procedural; it does not use metaphorical language that would need scrutiny for genericness.\",\"evidence\":[\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"Updates needed prior to re-review.\",\"Kind regards,\"]},{\"id\":\"referential_clarity\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"Pronouns and definite descriptions are recoverable from local context, and there is no notable cadence of vague referents.\",\"evidence\":[\"if they are happy with that we can re-review.\",\"but those are the main ones in progress right now.\",\"summary under the 'discussion' heading:\"]},{\"id\":\"formulaic_parallelism\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"Although several bullets share a status-update format, they are not empty balanced slogans or correction scripts where symmetry substitutes for content.\",\"evidence\":[\"- Find help: Up for 1st review Dec 10th.\",\"- Confirmation before submission: Up for 1st review Dec 10th.\",\"- Visual indicators: Up for 1st review Dec 17th.\"]},{\"id\":\"semantic_redundancy\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The bullets are concise and mostly additive; repeated scheduling phrasing reflects distinct items rather than redundant restatement of the same information.\",\"evidence\":[\"- Information in steps: Reviewed on Tuesday, up again next week:\",\"- Fixed Reference Points: Reviewed on Tuesday, up again next week:\",\"There are a couple more that you can find here:\"]},{\"id\":\"underspecified_language\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The cited phrases are genuinely underspecified: they gesture at concerns, scenarios, and options without naming the relevant details or criteria.\",\"evidence\":[\"Some concerns about how to define the visual aspects,\",\"in some (key) scenarios\",\"There is also a somewhat separate option to add techniques for personalisation once that spec reaches recommendation.\"]},{\"id\":\"context_leakage\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The note refers to prior process, but it does not contain answer-shaped defenses or corrections that require a missing chat exchange to make sense.\",\"evidence\":[\"Updates made since previous survey,\",\"Has been updated after previous reviews,\",\"Reviewed on Tuesday, up again next week:\"]},{\"id\":\"performed_candour\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"There are no sincerity announcements or authenticity boosters such as 'frankly' or 'honestly'.\",\"evidence\":[\"Hi everyone,\",\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"Kind regards,\"]},{\"id\":\"vacuous_connection\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The connectors used are ordinary and their relationships are recoverable from context; they do not pretend to supply logic while withholding it.\",\"evidence\":[\"if they are happy with that we can re-review.\",\"but those are the main ones in progress right now.\",\"rather than increase the spacing per-se.\"]},{\"id\":\"genre_specific\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"This is best treated as default rather than one of the named genres, and no genre-specific watchlist applies.\",\"evidence\":[\"Hi everyone,\",\"A quick update on the status of the various SCs we have going:\",\"Kind regards,\"]}]}"}}
